{
  "scene_id": "06_the_first_coming",
  "description": ".",
  "entities": [],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 6,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Analysis,\"",
        "line": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 9,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Primary Dominion designation confirmed,\"",
        "line": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 18,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Indigenous capability assessment,\"",
        "line": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 28,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Threat level?\"",
        "line": 41
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 30,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Minimal. The stone-entities possess significant physical strength and apparent vrill-conductivity, but lack coordinated military structure. The luminescent forms show sophisticated consciousness-crafting abilities but minimal defensive applications. Neither species demonstrates awareness of our presence. Recommended containment protocols: standard biological management with optional selective harvesting for vrill-extraction purposes.\"",
        "line": 44
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 34,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Deployment authorization,\"",
        "line": 50
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 36,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Acknowledged. Dispatching Overseer Council for ground coordination. Initiating manufacturing protocol authorization. Preparing Igigi transport vessels and Reptilian genesis facilities.\"",
        "line": 53
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Standard protocol: monitor, assess, contain if interference occurs. Harvest if vrill-extraction becomes necessary. Eliminate only if direct threat to construction objectives is confirmed.\"",
        "line": 58
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 40,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Efficient,\"",
        "line": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 62,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Foundation assessment,\"",
        "line": 91
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 66,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Bedrock stable to depth of four hundred meters. Vrill-flow optimal for energy extraction. Geological composition compatible with Reptilian genesis requirements. No indigenous presence within fifty kilometers. Atmospheric composition within acceptable parameters for extended Igigi habitation.\"",
        "line": 97
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 67,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Commence Phase One construction,\"",
        "line": 99
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 85,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Status report to Citadel command,\"",
        "line": 126
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 112,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Calculations will not change our trajectory,\"",
        "line": 163
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 114,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Calculations are all we have,\"",
        "line": 166
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 125,
      "actor": "Ishara",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can see it,\"",
        "line": 181
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 133,
      "actor": "Ishara",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Do you think they'll fight?\"",
        "line": 192
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 134,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The mathematics suggest they lack the capability,\"",
        "line": 194
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 166,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Cognitive assessment,\"",
        "line": 240
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 173,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Command structure integration,\"",
        "line": 249
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 182,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Deploy first generation to security positions,\"",
        "line": 262
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 210,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"She's beautiful,\"",
        "line": 301
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 211,
      "actor": "Ishara",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Naming feels like hope,\"",
        "line": 303
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 212,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Hope is all we have.\"",
        "line": 305
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 218,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They're preparing work assignments,\"",
        "line": 314
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 220,
      "actor": "Ishara",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What will they have us build?\"",
        "line": 317
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 221,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Something that will break this world,\"",
        "line": 319
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 228,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Will they fight?\"",
        "line": 328
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 229,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mathematics suggests they will resist. Whether that resistance proves sufficient...\"",
        "line": 330
      }
    }
  ],
